{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55200","headline":"赠同住归寂颂（一作《归寂吟赠同住》） · 智闲","name":"赠同住归寂颂（一作《归寂吟赠同住》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同住道人七十余，共辞城郭乐山居。\n身如寒木心芽（一作「牙」）绝，不话唐言休梵书。\n心期尽处身虽丧，如来弟子沙门样。\n深信共崇鉢塔成，巍巍置在青山嶂（一作「掌」）。\n观夫参道不虚然，脱去形骸惎（一作「甚」）高上。\n从来不说今朝事，暗里埋头隐玄畅。\n不留踪迹异人间，深妙神光饱明亮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55200.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55200","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}